  "outstanding": [
    "The normalized lowest-type kernels, the spectral splitting before pole matching, the central-character moments and the algebraic embedding of a shifted model are derived in the regular-shift input sections, and the realization theorem for the kernel and the growth bound for smooth vectors are derived in the realization sections. The Pieri rule for compact types is cited."
  ]
